WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.040 --> 01:30.610
Iyaa! Chocolat-chan, what should I do?

01:31.170 --> 01:33.980
I forgot the notebook with my
homework in it at home!

01:36.340 --> 01:38.510
Huh, homework? We had some?

01:38.910 --> 01:41.150
Yeah. We had arithmetic problems.

01:42.820 --> 01:44.520
I totally forgot!

01:45.490 --> 01:47.820
Even though I stayed up so late doing it.

01:49.220 --> 01:50.590
This is mine, but...

01:50.590 --> 01:51.960
If you don't mind, please copy it.

01:52.360 --> 01:53.560
Ah, but...

01:54.360 --> 01:56.420
But that wouldn't be right.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.430
Don't worry about it!

01:58.830 --> 02:01.170
Oh? Then if you don't mind...

02:01.770 --> 02:04.410
Not you, Kato! For Vanilla-chan!

02:05.340 --> 02:06.410
What's with that?

02:06.940 --> 02:10.410
Do you think Vanilla-chan is trying to get
sympathy from the boys on purpose?

02:10.780 --> 02:11.680
What do you think, Mitsuki?

02:13.150 --> 02:14.420
It has nothing to do with me.

02:15.120 --> 02:16.050
Whatever.

02:17.450 --> 02:18.250
Oh.

02:24.490 --> 02:27.230
More important than love!?
The magic of friendship.

02:36.440 --> 02:39.210
Ice-san, if we could talk for a moment...

02:41.810 --> 02:42.140
Sure.

02:46.950 --> 02:50.020
That girl was looking at Vanilla back then.

02:56.590 --> 03:00.160
Um, well, uh...

03:02.260 --> 03:03.000
I'm sorry!

03:04.700 --> 03:05.930
Why are you apologizing?

03:07.240 --> 03:07.900
Um...

03:09.470 --> 03:12.470
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

03:14.310 --> 03:19.180
I want to know how to be popular
with the guys like you, Ice-san.

03:20.920 --> 03:22.280
That's what I wanted to ask about.

03:23.220 --> 03:24.620
Um, boys...

03:27.290 --> 03:31.730
Ah, Shiratori-san, is it that you
have someone you like?

03:33.160 --> 03:35.930
Don't tell ANYONE, okay okay okay?!

03:37.100 --> 03:37.780
Sure.

03:39.600 --> 03:45.200
Actually, that's right.
Kosaka-senpai is so awesome!

03:45.200 --> 03:47.140
I only see him all the time in the library,

03:47.140 --> 03:50.010
but he has such a cool manner, always studying so quietly.

03:50.610 --> 03:54.750
And he's got the top grades in his class, and
he's the president of the classical club...

03:54.750 --> 03:57.220
Ah! Anyway, he's soo totally awesome!

04:02.920 --> 04:05.790
But I've hardly even spoken to him.

04:05.790 --> 04:06.960
Oh, I see.

04:08.930 --> 04:12.200
Please Ice-san! What should
I do to be popular?

04:12.200 --> 04:13.970
Even if it's just with
Kosaka-senpai, that'll be fine!

04:15.270 --> 04:17.740
Okay. But...

04:26.880 --> 04:28.480
Okay, sure.

04:29.020 --> 04:31.120
If it's okay with you, I'll help you out.

04:32.620 --> 04:33.460
Thank you!

04:39.930 --> 04:41.730
Is this really a good idea, Vanilla-chama?

04:42.100 --> 04:45.970
Instead of worrying about other people's love, you should be collecting hearts yourself.

04:45.970 --> 04:47.740
If it's just a little, it'll be fine.

04:49.870 --> 04:52.470
So what was it?
Did Shiratori want something?

04:52.470 --> 04:54.040
Nope, not at all.

04:54.040 --> 04:56.140
Now, afternoon classes are going to start.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.390
See, over there.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.660
The coolest looking person.

05:13.160 --> 05:13.960
That guy?

05:15.330 --> 05:16.260
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

05:18.430 --> 05:19.930
So that's Kosaka-senpai.

05:26.470 --> 05:29.010
He saw? Did he see? Was he looking over here?

05:29.010 --> 05:31.410
No, he was just lifting his head.

05:33.410 --> 05:34.380
Thank goodness.

05:35.780 --> 05:38.090
Why? You don't want to be found?

05:38.090 --> 05:39.020
But don't you like him?

05:40.320 --> 05:43.160
But, but... It's so embarrassing!

05:45.290 --> 05:46.960
I don't really understand humans.

05:47.560 --> 05:50.670
Like this "liking" a person feeling...

05:51.800 --> 05:56.400
I can't even handle Senpai looking at
me, there's no way I can talk to him!

05:56.770 --> 05:58.840
I just can't do this!

05:59.640 --> 06:02.510
That's not true. If you try your
best, it'll be fine.

06:03.540 --> 06:04.410
Really?

06:04.410 --> 06:04.980
Well, you see...

06:05.580 --> 06:08.450
You should try to start love
from another direction.

06:09.380 --> 06:10.180
In a different way?

06:10.650 --> 06:16.260
Yeah. You see, boys will want to
help girls that are in trouble.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.230
So then, you see...

06:22.930 --> 06:24.370
I'm supposed to carry this?

06:24.370 --> 06:29.700
Yeah. It's really heavy, so there's no
way a guy would leave you alone.

06:32.070 --> 06:34.180
I see! As expected from you, Ice-san!

06:34.180 --> 06:34.810
In that case...

06:42.980 --> 06:44.120
Are you okay?

06:44.620 --> 06:46.790
Like this, Senpai will surely...

06:49.420 --> 06:51.830
Make sure to look weak, like
you need to be saved, okay?

06:52.390 --> 06:53.100
That might be impossible.

07:04.740 --> 07:05.710
Outta the way, outta the way!

07:12.550 --> 07:13.310
Watch out!

07:15.350 --> 07:18.050
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

07:21.120 --> 07:21.620
Wand!

07:23.160 --> 07:25.060
Books, become snacks!

07:28.460 --> 07:29.500
I missed!

07:35.540 --> 07:37.070
Stop!

08:01.060 --> 08:02.800
I'm just no good!

08:03.900 --> 08:07.630
Don't give up after failing
just once, Mitsuki-chan.

08:16.540 --> 08:17.610
Now we're all set.

08:18.410 --> 08:21.050
You see, girls are more scared
of surprising things than boys.

08:21.050 --> 08:22.250
You see, girls are more scared
of surprising things than boys.

08:22.920 --> 08:25.290
If someone acts like they have a lot energy like you, Mitsuki,

08:25.290 --> 08:28.520
they'll think "Hey,
that girl's pretty neat."

08:29.620 --> 08:30.390
R-Right...

08:31.430 --> 08:32.860
So you see, this time...

08:33.560 --> 08:34.200
There he is.

08:35.260 --> 08:36.300
Good luck!

08:43.340 --> 08:47.740
K-Kya! There's a bug in my shoebox! A bug!

08:48.180 --> 08:49.310
What is it, Shiratori?

08:50.040 --> 08:50.710
A bug?

08:51.310 --> 08:53.720
What? It's just a pine cone.

08:54.450 --> 08:56.220
You're scared of something like this?

08:56.220 --> 08:57.970
You've got to be kidding me.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.750
Shut up!

09:00.560 --> 09:02.020
Ah... See ya.

09:03.020 --> 09:03.860
Mitsuki-chan.

09:07.030 --> 09:08.900
I screwed up again...

09:08.900 --> 09:11.500
Don't worry about it.
Try hard the next time.

09:19.210 --> 09:21.110
Ah, I'm starving.

09:21.780 --> 09:24.310
You can't just lie around
at a time like this!

09:24.880 --> 09:27.680
Right now, Vanilla's
collecting a lot of hearts!

09:28.460 --> 09:29.620
You think?

09:29.620 --> 09:31.320
Duh!

09:31.320 --> 09:33.350
Otherwise she wouldn't have
told you to go home first!

09:36.190 --> 09:36.990
I'm home!

09:40.930 --> 09:41.500
Welcome back.

09:42.930 --> 09:46.400
Um... Did you collect a lot of hearts?

09:46.400 --> 09:50.870
Huh? I didn't collect any hearts or anything.

09:55.110 --> 09:57.820
Yes? Ah, Mitsuki-chan.

09:58.810 --> 10:03.920
I'm really sorry about today, I didn't think
that there'd be someone interfering.

10:06.020 --> 10:09.390
Yeah, true. Mimura-kun is awful.

10:10.020 --> 10:12.380
Vanilla, Vanilla, what about dinner?

10:12.690 --> 10:14.460
Hurry up and make something.

10:14.460 --> 10:14.860
Huh?

10:16.060 --> 10:18.630
Ah, sorry. I'll see you tomorrow at school.

10:20.370 --> 10:23.790
There should be something in the
refrigerator, so just eat that.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.880
Vanilla kind of looks really busy.

10:29.880 --> 10:31.080
Who's Mitsuki?

10:31.510 --> 10:32.210
Who knows?

10:37.570 --> 10:38.790
Sugar Sugar Rune!

10:39.250 --> 10:40.250
Choco Rune!

10:49.900 --> 10:51.700
Time to eat!

10:51.700 --> 10:53.830
Don't use magic for something like that!

10:53.830 --> 10:55.270
Leave me alone!

10:55.270 --> 10:55.970
I'll whup your...

10:57.410 --> 10:57.840
...butt.

10:59.940 --> 11:02.780
What's going on with Vanilla?

11:15.560 --> 11:18.330
Really. It's nothing, really.

11:18.890 --> 11:23.230
Really? But it seemed that
Shiratori didn't like you.

11:24.570 --> 11:27.230
But Mitsuki-chan is really a nice
person once you talk to her.

11:31.410 --> 11:32.470
I'll be right back.

11:34.710 --> 11:35.310
Vanilla!

11:36.040 --> 11:39.950
Now's your chance! Collect lots of
hearts while Vanilla's not here!

11:40.550 --> 11:43.320
Sheesh, what is Vanilla-chama thinking?

11:44.920 --> 11:49.020
Helping people with their love problems
isn't going to earn Vanilla any hearts.

11:49.560 --> 11:50.390
People's love?

11:51.560 --> 11:52.960
Um...

11:53.860 --> 11:56.700
Ack! I'm blabbing!

11:56.700 --> 11:57.320
About what?

11:58.930 --> 11:59.730
Well...

12:00.670 --> 12:02.470
Maybe I should just give up.

12:03.900 --> 12:08.440
But I feel like Senpai
doesn't even know I exist.

12:08.880 --> 12:12.480
How can you be this shy?
It's not like you, Mitsuki.

12:13.210 --> 12:17.050
Instead of regretting it later, you have
to try what you can now, right?

12:18.690 --> 12:20.660
Vanilla-chan, you're strong.

12:21.060 --> 12:26.430
Well you see, I was just really happy
you asked me for advice, Mitsuki.

12:26.430 --> 12:28.660
So I thought I could help you out.

12:29.490 --> 12:29.960
Sure.

12:30.300 --> 12:32.970
If there is something I can do, I'll do it.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.190
So just go for it.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.100
Thank you.

12:39.570 --> 12:40.270
Rain...

12:41.540 --> 12:43.840
Mitsuki-chan, this might be your chance.

12:51.350 --> 12:54.620
I'm sure he has an umbrella
with him. I'm just sure of it.

12:55.160 --> 12:56.220
Don't worry about it.

13:06.170 --> 13:07.400
Sugar Sugar Rune.

13:08.200 --> 13:09.070
Vani Rune!

13:10.340 --> 13:10.870
Umbrella, fly into the sky!

13:10.870 --> 13:12.300
Umbrella, fly into the sky!

13:16.610 --> 13:17.950
W... Wha?

13:21.580 --> 13:22.680
Now, good luck.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.020
Right.

13:29.260 --> 13:31.630
Um... Kosaka senpai...

13:32.660 --> 13:34.000
Ah, you're that...

13:35.600 --> 13:37.670
I'm Shiratori Mitsuki from class 5A.

13:37.670 --> 13:38.230
Okay.

13:39.570 --> 13:42.070
Want to... share an umbrella?

13:43.040 --> 13:44.770
Yeah, fine. Is that okay?

13:46.570 --> 13:47.270
Sure!

13:49.810 --> 13:50.410
Thank you.

13:54.120 --> 13:55.250
Alright!

14:00.120 --> 14:01.690
Sorry, I'll carry it.

14:02.220 --> 14:03.260
I'm sorry.

14:03.860 --> 14:05.190
Yesterday was amazing.

14:06.430 --> 14:10.360
At the library, it was the first time
I'd ever seen something like that.

14:10.360 --> 14:11.800
Oh my, how embarrassing.

14:13.430 --> 14:16.200
Back then, you were with
the girl with short hair...

14:17.340 --> 14:19.270
Are you friends?

14:19.270 --> 14:21.540
Yes. You mean Ice-san?

14:21.540 --> 14:23.780
She's a classmate, and a friend of mine.

14:24.250 --> 14:27.520
I see. She seems really popular.

14:28.020 --> 14:29.080
Because she's so cute.

14:33.220 --> 14:34.360
It's pouring out.

14:37.790 --> 14:38.330
Coming!

14:42.660 --> 14:43.980
Shiratori?

14:45.030 --> 14:45.700
What's the matter?

14:47.900 --> 14:48.870
Is Vanilla-chan here?

14:49.870 --> 14:53.840
Vanilla's taking a bath right now,
but please, come inside.

14:59.780 --> 15:02.380
What happened? You have an umbrella so, why?

15:04.220 --> 15:06.220
This totally sucks!

15:08.120 --> 15:10.930
Senpai only cares about Vanilla-chan.

15:11.390 --> 15:14.400
By Senpai, you mean that Kosaka guy...

15:17.930 --> 15:19.200
Oh? Mitsuki-chan?

15:20.470 --> 15:22.480
What happened, you're all wet...

15:22.480 --> 15:24.210
I see you broke your promise.

15:25.470 --> 15:30.780
I told you not to tell anyone, but you told Kato-san about Kosaka-senpai, didn't you?

15:31.450 --> 15:33.310
Huh? But I didn't...

15:36.650 --> 15:42.720
From the beginning you said you'd do anything
for me, you said you'd help me...

15:43.520 --> 15:45.630
But you just found me amusing!

15:45.630 --> 15:48.420
That's wrong! That's not what
I thought, Mitsuki-chan!

15:49.060 --> 15:50.100
You can't fool me anymore.

15:50.800 --> 15:53.800
Kosaka-senpai just talked the whole
time about you, Vanilla-chan!

15:55.100 --> 15:58.430
I'm sure that the one he
likes is you, Vanilla-chan!

16:00.640 --> 16:02.940
I was a fool asking you for advice!

16:03.580 --> 16:05.230
I hate you!

16:05.480 --> 16:07.010
I'm through with you!

16:07.010 --> 16:07.950
Mitsuki-chan!

16:09.550 --> 16:13.950
I'm sorry, Vanilla. I heard about
Kosaka-senpai from Blanca.

16:14.420 --> 16:15.590
And I just...

16:15.990 --> 16:19.830
You were just helping out your friend
instead of collecting hearts!

16:20.360 --> 16:21.160
It's fine...

16:22.560 --> 16:23.100
But...

16:24.270 --> 16:25.730
I'm always like this.

16:27.370 --> 16:31.640
I thought I had made my first friend,
not counting Chocolat.

16:33.010 --> 16:34.880
Please leave me alone for a little while.

16:37.380 --> 16:38.410
Vanilla...

16:41.120 --> 16:45.650
Please tell me what I can do for
Vanilla, Fortune Telling Book!

16:46.050 --> 16:47.120
What should I do?

16:48.620 --> 16:50.860
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

16:52.190 --> 16:54.260
Divination, Livre!

17:04.440 --> 17:05.740
Door of memories.

17:06.440 --> 17:11.280
The answer to your question may be
among the memories in your heart.

17:17.790 --> 17:18.550
Memories.

17:27.630 --> 17:30.360
Something like this happened
to us before, you know.

17:31.130 --> 17:35.840
Remember, before we went to
the Magical World school...

17:35.840 --> 17:38.370
I blabbed about how you wet
the bed to Houx and Saule.

17:38.940 --> 17:39.520
Yeah.

17:42.240 --> 17:46.250
You were soo mad at me for that,
you said "I'm through with you!"

17:46.250 --> 17:48.120
Yeah, I did...

17:49.420 --> 17:52.350
Even though we wanted to
make up, we couldn't.

17:53.120 --> 17:56.660
But soon after, I came down with a heavy
fever and had to stay in bed.

17:58.890 --> 18:01.430
And before we knew it, we'd made up.

18:03.560 --> 18:04.400
Yeah.

18:04.400 --> 18:07.570
After that, no matter what we fight about...

18:07.570 --> 18:09.800
We always made up before we realized it.

18:09.800 --> 18:13.170
Yeah, fighting, making up.
That's the way it should be.

18:13.840 --> 18:16.040
So, I'm sure with Shiratori that...

18:16.040 --> 18:18.310
It's no good, she won't trust me.

18:19.050 --> 18:22.420
I'll talk to her. I'll tell her that you
didn't say anything to me.

18:22.880 --> 18:23.850
But...

18:24.790 --> 18:27.860
Hey, is it true that
Kosaka-senpai likes you, Vanilla?

18:28.490 --> 18:32.390
I don't know. I didn't think of that at all.

18:33.960 --> 18:35.100
What if we find out?

18:36.500 --> 18:36.860
Okay.

18:43.640 --> 18:48.040
Ah, you must be Ice-san.

18:48.510 --> 18:48.910
Yes.

18:52.510 --> 18:53.150
It's "Pee" colored.

18:53.580 --> 18:56.850
I heard about you from
Shiratori-san yesterday.

18:56.850 --> 18:58.120
We went home together.

18:58.120 --> 19:00.290
Shiratori-san let me use her umbrella.

19:01.160 --> 19:02.220
I have a favor to ask!

19:03.360 --> 19:09.030
Mitsuki-chan... I mean, Shiratori-san told me
she wants to talk to you again, Senpai.

19:09.030 --> 19:10.900
So will you meet with her?

19:11.330 --> 19:13.130
Um, right now?

19:16.670 --> 19:19.810
Really! Vanilla didn't tell me!

19:19.810 --> 19:21.940
I just, on my own...

19:22.480 --> 19:24.180
I don't want to hear your excuses!

19:27.480 --> 19:29.680
Fine. In that case...

19:30.850 --> 19:33.050
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

19:34.660 --> 19:36.960
Huh? Wha... What is this?

19:44.770 --> 19:48.100
Chocolat-chan, will you manage
to bring Mitsuki-chan here?

19:54.940 --> 19:55.840
Ah, jeez...

19:56.440 --> 19:57.280
Ow, ow...

19:57.280 --> 19:58.610
What the heck are you doing?

19:58.610 --> 19:59.380
Hey, you!

20:02.320 --> 20:04.220
Senpai, save me!

20:06.490 --> 20:08.060
So is this your boyfriend or something?

20:09.720 --> 20:11.520
Ah, this might turn out good.

20:14.700 --> 20:16.030
What a disappointment.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.930
What's with this weakling?

20:17.930 --> 20:21.770
Senpai is cultured, unlike you guys!

20:21.770 --> 20:22.370
What?!

20:22.870 --> 20:24.870
Ah, crap! What are we going to do, Vanilla?

20:26.570 --> 20:27.080
Vanilla!

20:28.680 --> 20:29.780
Mitsuki-chan, run!

20:30.310 --> 20:31.110
Vanilla-chan...

20:31.480 --> 20:32.810
Who the hell are you?

20:32.810 --> 20:33.880
Hurry and run!

20:34.720 --> 20:35.820
But Senpai is...

20:37.050 --> 20:38.090
Wait right there!

20:40.350 --> 20:40.920
Vanilla...

20:41.360 --> 20:43.220
Chocolat-chan, lend me your power.

20:43.860 --> 20:44.560
Sure!

20:45.590 --> 20:48.630
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

20:51.400 --> 20:51.930
Wand!

20:53.070 --> 20:55.700
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

20:56.540 --> 20:57.040
Wand!

21:09.480 --> 21:10.450
We did it!

21:11.720 --> 21:12.990
What happened to those two?

21:13.420 --> 21:14.890
They disappeared.

21:15.690 --> 21:17.460
You drove them away, Shiratori-san?

21:18.330 --> 21:18.990
Huh?

21:18.990 --> 21:19.960
That's amazing!

21:21.460 --> 21:23.500
You really are amazing, Shiratori-san!

21:35.840 --> 21:39.350
I'm glad we could get Kosaka-senpai
and Mitsuki-chan together.

21:39.750 --> 21:43.250
Yeah. You really tried
hard for them, Vanilla.

21:45.450 --> 21:47.820
Well, that's because you
saved me, Chocolat-chan.

21:47.820 --> 21:48.990
I didn't really...

21:51.090 --> 21:54.450
You and Mitsuki-chan are
kind of similar.

21:55.530 --> 21:56.260
You think?

21:56.860 --> 22:02.040
Yeah. So, I couldn't leave her alone.

22:07.070 --> 22:09.240
Ah, I see.

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.970 --> 23:51.300
There are a lot of cats around me, but are cats really that cute?

23:51.300 --> 23:53.840
I think frogs and snakes are more fun.

23:54.760 --> 23:57.560
Oh yeah, doesn't Pierre have a cat?

